Package: prepTCGAdata
Type: Package
Title: Prepare TCGA Data for the SJV and SJVC Apps
Version: 1.9.0
Authors@R:
  person(given = "Phaedra",
         family = "Agius",
         role = c("aut", "cre"),
         email = "phaedragius@gmail.com")
Description: Downloads TCGA splice-junction data and clinical metadata via
    recount3 and the GDC/cBioPortal APIs, annotates junctions against a
    GENCODE reference, and prepares the metadata for overall-survival
    analysis with the SJV and SJVC apps.
